function Panel({title,children}:{title:string;children:React.ReactNode}){return <section className="panel"><h2>{title}</h2>{children}</section>}function Row({n,v}:{n:string;v:string}){return <div className="row"><span>{n}</span><b>{v}</b></div>}const rootElement=document.getElementById("root");if(rootElement)createRoot(rootElement).render(<LanguageProvider>{(import.meta.env.VITE_OLCR_UI_PREVIEW==="models"||(import.meta.env.DEV&&new URLSearchParams(location.search).get("ui-preview")==="models"))?<ModelUiPreview/>:<App/>}</LanguageProvider>);
